rooms_desc ({"You see the big garden of Aztlans house.Flowers and trees are growing here.A magic sun created by Aztlan spends a warm light.Under the bigges tree you can see a magic emerald holded from a statue.Behind some trees you can see a big house.The house is build with some special stones.On the top of the house you can see some doves.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is Aztlan's thinking room.Here is the place where Aztlan can rest and think abouthis fights, problems and magic.In the west corner you can see some books and scripts.On the floor you can see some open books.In the east corner you can see a small sign.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,0,0,0,0,0,})
